### Sway mask generation
```csharp
private static string BuildSwayMask(Texture2D foreground, BuildState state)
{
    const int w = 96, h = 137;
    // down-sample alpha with a box filter
    float[] src = new float[w*h];
    for (int j=0;j<h;j++) {
      float v = (j+0.5f)/h;
      for (int i=0;i<w;i++) {
        float u = (i+0.5f)/w;
        src[j*w+i] = foreground.GetPixelBilinear(u,v).a;   // hmm, only one sample
      }
    }
```
Better: accumulate multiple samples per cell (e.g. 2x2 or 3x3) for a proper box average. Let me sample 2x2 within each cell → 96*137*4 = 52k GetPixelBilinear calls. That's fine (maybe ~50ms).

